# The distribution repository is a checksummed artifact store, not source code.
#
# catalog.json carries a SHA-256 for every package, and PI-Desktop refuses a
# download whose bytes do not match, so any line-ending conversion corrupts
# published data. `-text` disables normalization for every path in both
# directions; nothing in this repository should be treated as text.
#
# Maintained by pi-plugin-center. Do not edit by hand.
* -text

catalog.json -text -diff -merge
*.piplug -text -diff -merge -filter
